Unzip the file "trace.tar.bz" before running the program

More datasets are available at https://userweb.cs.txstate.edu/~burtscher/research/datasets/FPdouble/

For example, to download a dataset for the benchmark:

  wget --no-check-certificate http://www.cs.txstate.edu/~burtscher/research/datasets/FPdouble/msg_sp.trace.fpc

The data needs to be uncompressed. Please see the Makefile for more details.

